desc:MakeGain Tap Mono — copies channel 1 into 2 (mono aux tap, mono tracks)
//tags: utility gain-staging makegain
//author: auto-make-gain (AGPLv3, https://github.com/…/auto-make-gain)
//
// Mono-track variant of MakeGain Tap (FR §10.1/§10.7, A2). AUS bus rule:
// a mono track gets a mono main (pin 1) and a mono aux (pin 2). Place
// FIRST in the chain; MakeGain (mono build), LAST:
//
//   chain order:  [MakeGain Tap Mono] … chain FX … [MakeGain]
//
// The copy rides lane 2 untouched by mono FX (they process lane 1 only),
// so MakeGain's aux reads the pre-chain dry.

in_pin:audio (mono)
out_pin:audio (mono)
out_pin:dry (mono)

@sample
spl1 = spl0;
